{"timestamp": 1779430441.4624002, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 11, "data": {"caller": "player_2", "reason": "Charlie reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "navigation", "victim_name": "Bob"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779430441.4633512, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779430448.9013555, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I found Bob's body in Navigation. I've been pathing from Security to Weapons, back to Security, and then down to Navigation where I found him. \n\nEarlier in the round, I saw Diana coming from Navigation into Security. I also bumped into Frank in Security a bit after that, and Alice was in Security much later on. Diana, did you see anyone in or near Navigation when you left? Everyone else, let us know your routes."}}
{"timestamp": 1779430459.7316573, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Charlie, to answer your question, when I was in Navigation at the very start of the round, I didn't see anyone. I moved up to Security, and that's actually where I saw Bob alive around tick 3! \n\nWhen I was in Security, Bob, Charlie, and Frank were all there. Frank had just walked in from Weapons. So Bob definitely made it out of Navigation and into Security early on. After that, I headed left into Electrical and bumped into Alice around tick 5, then I went to Medbay to do my scan. \n\nSince Bob was alive in Security with Charlie and Frank, he must have headed back down to Navigation after I left. Frank, you were in Security with them\u2014where did you go after that? Did anyone see who Bob left Security with?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779430474.801117, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I've been completely isolated on the left side of the map this entire round. I started in Storage, moved to Lower Engine, and just got to Upper Engine. I haven't seen a single soul all game. \n\nMy total isolation actually backs up what Diana and Charlie are saying\u2014it sounds like almost the entire lobby was clumped up on the right side around Security, Weapons, and Electrical. \n\nSince Diana confirms Bob was alive in Security at tick 3 with Charlie and Frank, the killer has to be whoever went down to Navigation with Bob after that. Charlie, since you found the body in Nav and were with him in Security, you're definitely a suspect for a self-report. But we really need to hear from Frank and Alice next to piece together the rest of the timeline. \n\nFrank, where did you go after you were in Security with Bob and Charlie? Alice, did you see Bob when you were moving through Electrical and Security? I don't have any direct evidence since I was alone on the left, so I'm relying on the rest of you to narrow down who followed Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779430525.0688038, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Yeah, so my route was Cafeteria \u2192 Weapons \u2192 Security. When I got into Security, Bob was alive there with us. I specifically remember Charlie leaving Security toward Weapons, and then Bob headed down toward Navigation shortly after. I did **not** go down with Bob \u2014 I stayed around Security briefly and then cut left through Electrical/Medbay side and ended up in Storage when the report happened.\n\nSo from what I saw, Bob was alive when he left Security toward Navigation, and Charlie was the one whose route was Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 back Security \u2192 Navigation where the body gets reported. That could be legit, but it also puts Charlie in the best position for a self-report if he doubled back after Bob.\n\nI don\u2019t have info on Alice yet, so I want to hear her route, but right now the main question is: who followed Bob into Navigation after he left Security? Charlie\u2019s story is the closest to that body."}}
{"timestamp": 1779430544.3011062, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I can clear both Diana and Charlie. Diana, I can confirm you entered Electrical from Security at tick 5, exactly as you said. Charlie, I was in Security at tick 8 when you came down from Weapons, and I saw you head down to Navigation at tick 9, which perfectly matches your timeline of finding the body right after. \n\nFrank, you are completely caught. You claimed you left Security and cut left through the Electrical and Medbay side to get to Storage. But Diana and I were passing through Electrical and Medbay the entire first half of the round, and neither of us saw you there. \n\nYou know what room *does* connect directly to Storage, though? Navigation. You followed Bob into Nav, killed him, and then took the direct hallway from Nav straight to Storage. You lied about your route through Electrical/Medbay because you didn't want to admit you went south and were anywhere near the body. \n\nEveryone, vote Frank. He just outed himself with a fake route."}}
{"timestamp": 1779430563.4400866, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Alice's logic is completely sound. I can confirm that when I left Security to head up to Weapons around tick 4, I left Frank and Bob together in that room. If Frank claims he went left through Electrical and Medbay but didn't run into Diana or Alice, then he's definitely lying about his path to Storage. The route from Security down to Navigation, and then left into Storage is the only one that makes sense for his positioning and the timing of the body. Frank, you've been caught in a lie, and you were the last one with Bob. I'm fully on board with voting Frank today."}}
{"timestamp": 1779430576.954036, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Frank"}}
